{"id":"wb-8-373","name":"怀邦会馆","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"怀邦会馆","text":"怀邦会馆位于中华人民共和国河南省禹州市市区西北隅文卫路东侧，原名“覃怀会馆”，为怀庆府的药商于清同治十一年所建（1872年）。由于修建会馆的砖面上模印有阳文“怀邦”二字，故得名。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%80%80%E9%82%A6%E4%BC%9A%E9%A6%86","revisionId":88421213,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88421213","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c14028328eaa689720d2a8b2.jpg","title":"20240710_Huai_Guild_Hall_05.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240710_Huai_Guild_Hall_05.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a3/20240710_Huai_Guild_Hall_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​禹州怀帮会馆","width":320,"height":213}}